#. これだけか…？
#. 他の連中はどうした…？
msgctxt "0001 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "Is this it? What happened to the others?"
msgstr ""

#. …来ないね。
msgctxt "0002 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Aren't they coming...?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0003 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>食堂にいたのは、
#. 大神さんと朝日奈さん、霧切さんの３人だけ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There were only three people in the dining\n"
"hall—Sakura, Hina, and Kyoko...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>つまり、ボクを含めて…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So including me...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. たった４人…だけ？
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Only...four people?"
msgstr ""

#. もうっ！　これだから時間にルーズな連中は
#. 困るんだよッ！
msgctxt "0007 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"God! This is why I hate people who take their sweet\n"
"time with everything!"
msgstr ""

#. ともかく、他の連中が集まるまで、
#. もう少し待つしかあるまい…
msgctxt "0008 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Anyway, let's wait a little while longer for the\n"
"others."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そして、ボクらは待つ事にした。
#. 他のみんながやって来るのを…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So we decided to wait, in case anyone else showed up.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だけど、いつまで待っても…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But no matter how long we waited...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ねぇ、もう８時だよ…
#. 集合時間から１時間も経っているのに…
msgctxt "0011 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"So...it's 8 o'clock. We've been waiting here a full\n"
"hour..."
msgstr ""

#. …なぜ誰も来ない？
msgctxt "0012 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "Why haven't the others come?"
msgstr ""

#. 葉隠とセレスちゃんなんて、
#. 今まで、１度も休んだ事なかったのに…
msgctxt "0013 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Hiro and Celeste have never missed a day...till now."
msgstr ""

#. それに、もっと気になるのは…
#. 山田クンと石丸クンだよ。
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"And what I'm really worried about is...Hifumi and\n"
"Taka."
msgstr ""

#. あんなに捜索をやる気だった２人が、
#. 揃って来てないなんて…
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"They were more eager than anyone to look for Alter\n"
"Ego...and they're not here."
msgstr ""

#. …何かあったわね。
msgctxt "0016 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Something must have happened."
msgstr ""

#. え…！？
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh...?"
msgstr ""

#. うかつだったわ…
#. アルターエゴに気を取られ過ぎてた…
msgctxt "0018 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I was careless. I was too distracted by Alter Ego..."
msgstr ""

#. モノクマが動機を提示して、
#. それで何事もなく終わるなんて…そんなはずないのに。
msgctxt "0019 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"But Monokuma gave us a motive. There was no way\n"
"something wouldn't happen eventually."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>モノクマの提示した動機って…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Monokuma's motive...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ひゃっくおっくえーん！！
msgctxt "0021 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Ten million dollars!"
msgstr ""

#. もし卒業生が出た場合のプレゼントにします！
msgctxt "0022 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"I've prepared this graduation present for whichever\n"
"lucky student makes it out of here alive!"
msgstr ""

#. どう？　１００億円だよ！
#. ひゃっくおっくえーん！！
msgctxt "0023 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Whaddya think? It's ten million bucks! Ten million\n"
"smackaroos!"
msgstr ""

#. もう、ウッハウッハでしょ！？
msgctxt "0024 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "It's like totally wowie wow wow, am I right!?"
msgstr ""

#. まさか、お金なんかの為に…
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Don't tell me someone did something...for money!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>と、言いかけた言葉を飲み込んだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0026 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That's what I wanted to say, but I didn't bother.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクは、もうわかっているはずだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0027 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I already understood.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>イヤってほど、わかっているはずだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I understood, and I hated that I did.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>他人の事を完全に理解するなんて、
#. 出来っこない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>You can never really know another person completely.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だから…ここでは何が起きても不思議じゃない。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Anything can happen here, and you can't consider it\n"
"\"strange.\" Not really...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 捜しに行った方がいいわね。
#. 来ていない、みんなを…
msgctxt "0031 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "We need to go look for the people who never showed up."
msgstr ""

#. そ、そうだね。
#. ちょっと様子を見に行こうか…
msgctxt "0032 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "O-Okay. Let's go track them down..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクらは、すぐに食堂を飛び出していた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0033 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Without another word, we left the dining hall.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
